{"id":"db72d6d752e21e20","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-open-geometric-morphism.md","title":"Definition — 开几何态射","display":"Definition — 开几何态射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-open-geometric-morphism","aliases":["14-df-open-geometric-morphism"],"display":"Definition — 开几何态射","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-open-geometric-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-open-geometric-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 开几何态射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a94cb99ec341b7c\" href=\"?note=0a94cb99ec341b7c\" title=\"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects\">14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_E\">\\(f_E\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a94cb99ec341b7c\" href=\"?note=0a94cb99ec341b7c\" title=\"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects\">14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects</a>，子对象逆像见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\">\\(L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\)</span> 为候选单调函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsOpen}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists(L_E)_{E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)}\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\bigl(L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\ \\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\\n(L_E(A)\\le B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le f_E(B))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall E,E&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(E&#39;,E)\\\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\\n\\bigl(u^{-1}(L_E(A))=L_{E&#39;}((f^*u)^{-1}(A))\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsOpen}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists(L_E)_{E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)}\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\bigl(L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\ \\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\\n(L_E(A)\\le B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le f_E(B))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall E,E&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(E&#39;,E)\\\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\\n\\bigl(u^{-1}(L_E(A))=L_{E&#39;}((f^*u)^{-1}(A))\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确来源：原书 IX.6 Definition 2，印刷 p.495，DjVu253右页。开性是子对象序层面的左伴随及基变换自然性；不要求整个逆像函子 f* 存在左伴随。旧定义把这两类伴随混在一起。两组条件现位于同一作用域内；基变换项独立量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,E&#39;\">\\(E,E&#39;\\)</span>，不从另一合取项借用绑定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f_E$ 见 [[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]，子对象逆像见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)$ 为候选单调函数。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f_E$ 见 [[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]，子对象逆像见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)$ 为候选单调函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"f_E","display":false},{"tex":"L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsOpen}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists(L_E)_{E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)}\\ \\bigl[&\n\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\bigl(L_E:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\ \\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(E)\\\n(L_E(A)\\le B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le f_E(B))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall E,E'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(E',E)\\\n\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*E)\\\n\\bigl(u^{-1}(L_E(A))=L_{E'}((f^*u)^{-1}(A))\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E,E'","display":false}],"bytes":1801,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-geometric-morphism|Definition — 开几何态射]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-geometric-morphism]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-open-geometric-morphism|Definition — 开几何态射]]"}],"outgoing":["0a94cb99ec341b7c","d3923e299ec2ec5a","b51ff4f43221971d","9752b779c5f463f9"]}